        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 1903<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Quad-Core (i5 2300) or AMD Octo-Core (FX 8150)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB AMD or 4 GB NVIDIA GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card with latest drivers<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Would also recommend a SSD or HDD cache to help with load times.</li></ul>"
